DESCRIPTION:Get a ticket to the 2026 Lancaster Craft Beerfest! Choose from two sessions and enjoy delicious local & regional brews\, live music\, delicious food vendors\, and good vibes in downtown Lancaster\, PA. The Beerfest is on Saturday\, August 22\, 2026. The event is 21+ \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
