SUMMARY:Long's Park Summer Music Series Free Concert
DESCRIPTION:The Long’s Park Summer Music Series returns for the 2026 season\, bringing free outdoor concerts to the Lancaster community once again. Kicking off on June 7 and running every Sunday at 7:30PM through August 23\, the series will offer 12 evenings of music on the lawn of Long’s Park. Concert goers can purchase brand exclusive Foxduck merchandise at all of the concerts with select evenings featuring a beer garden hosted by Jimmy Juice. \n\n\n\n\n    LINEUP
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/longs-park-summer-music-series-free-concert/2026-08-23/
LOCATION:Long’s Park\, 1441 Harrisburg Pike\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/avif:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/Galactic-2025-edited.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Long's Park Amphitheater Foundation":MAILTO:info@longspark.org
END:VEVENT
