SUMMARY:48th Annual Long's Park Art Festival
DESCRIPTION:What began as a local fundraiser in 1979 has evolved into one of the nation’s premier outdoor art events. Every Labor Day weekend\, the Long’s Park Art Festival transforms the park into a vibrant\, three-day gallery showcasing over 200 juried exhibitors from across the country. Attracting thousands of art lovers from across the Mid-Atlantic\, the festival celebrates creative talent while directly funding Long’s Park’s beloved Summer Music Series.Tickets are available to purchase on the Long’s Park website or you can purchase them at the door. Guest ages 25 and under are free.  \n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/48th-annual-longs-park-art-festival/
LOCATION:Long’s Park\, 1441 Harrisburg Pike\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17601\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/Art-Fest-Scenic-54801283868_64c70d0e15_k.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Long's Park Amphitheater Foundation":MAILTO:info@longspark.org
END:VEVENT
