SUMMARY:Central Market Flower's 5th Birthday Bash
DESCRIPTION:Join Central Market Flowers for an evening of flowers\, treats\, prizes\, and birthday fun. Enjoy free mini Lancaster Cupcakes\, a special gift for Flower Fan Club members\, a chance to win with our birthday prize wheel\, and a grand prize of a free ticket to one of our fresh flower workshops! Plus\, check out our ticketed Bouquet Making Workshop and create your own beautiful design with guidance from our floral design team. Come celebrate five blooming years! \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
