SUMMARY:Covenant Chocolate Chip Cookie Concert
DESCRIPTION:CHOCOLATE CHIP COOKIE CONCERT Join Covenant United Methodist Church for a First Friday Concert featuring the “Sound of Roses Big Band”. From Dorsey to Disco\, local musicians thrill with jazz\, disco\, rock\, and swing music. There will be fresh\, homemade chocolate chip cookies\, and art displayed by local artists Sandy Leonard & Joanne McIlvaine.
