SUMMARY:Bouquet Making Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate with flowers! In this hands-on bouquet-making workshop\, you’ll create a celebration-ready arrangement featuring beautiful local stems while learning a pro techniques you can use again and again to make full\, gorgeous bouquets at home. Come raise a glass\, play with flowers\, and leave with a bouquet of your own!  \n\n\n\n Registration is required\, and spots are limited—so secure your place today! Whether you’re a flower enthusiast or a beginner looking to try something new\, this class is a perfect opportunity to learn from the best while having fun with flowers. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
