SUMMARY:Fall Open House at Perfect Pots
DESCRIPTION:\Embrace the magic of the changing seasons at the Perfect Pots Fall Open House! Step into the Strasburg greenhouse to explore a vibrant selection of fall favorites—including bright celosia\, colorful ornamental kale\, and a huge variety of mums\, all curated specifically for performance in container gardens. Guests can sip local apple cider and enjoy sweet seasonal treats while strolling through a greenhouse filled with inspiring autumn displays. \n\n\n\nDuring the visit\, attendees can join an expert designer for a Fall Garden Trends Tour to get fresh ideas and easy planting “recipes” (registration is suggested\, but not required). Plus\, visitors can take advantage of the Complimentary Design Service by dropping off mid-sized summer pots for the team to transform into fall masterpieces. Don’t forget to spin the wheel at checkout\, where everyone wins discounts\, garden goodies\, and more! Perfect Pots looks forward to hosting a day of cozy seasonal vibes and creative inspiration for all. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/fall-open-house-at-perfect-pots/
LOCATION:Perfect Pots Greenhouse\, 745 Strasburg Pike\, Strasburg\, PA\, 17579\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/2026-PP-Website-Workshop-FB-Events.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Perfect Pots":MAILTO:marketing@perfectpots.com
END:VEVENT
