SUMMARY:Lancaster MusicFest
DESCRIPTION:Bring your crew\, your blanket\, and your appetite. On September 12\, Buchanan Park turns into Lancaster’s favorite outdoor party as the SmartHub Foundation presents the 7th annual Lancaster MusicFest\, a full day of live music\, local food\, and good company under the open sky.  \n\n\n\nSip local craft beer\, wine\, and spirits. Grab a bite from Lancaster’s best food vendors. Catch street performers\, shop handmade goods from local artisans\, and settle into open green space with friends and family. It’s music\, community\, and Lancaster County all in one place. Every ticket supports two causes close to home: Children’s Miracle Network and Schreiber Pediatric. Since day one\, MusicFest has existed to amplify the local organizations making Lancaster more engaged\, healthier\, and more vibrant. Come for the music. Stay for the community. This is Lancaster at its best. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-musicfest-4/
LOCATION:Buchanan Park\, 901 Buchanan Avenue\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/2025LancMusicFest-49.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="SmartHub Foundation":MAILTO:jeremy@lancastermusicfest.com
END:VEVENT
